"jarahan dengan 'Alt'."

#: ../../../src/MenuConfig.cpp:356
msgid ""
"Always hide loot tooltips, except for when a piece of loot is hovered with "
"the mouse cursor. Temporarily show all loot tooltips with 'Alt'."
